&lt;DELETED&gt;SEC. 411. REQUIREMENTS RELATED TO CONTROL PERSONS.&lt;/DELETED&gt;

&lt;DELETED&gt;    The Commodity Exchange Act (7 U.S.C. 1 et seq.), as 
